scenario: DISK-STICK-01
title: Write the startup disk to a USB stick
area: Install
rows: F-INST-07, F-NET-17
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A spare USB stick (everything on it will be erased) and the image file. Another computer to try the stick on.
step: Open the installer tile and choose the stick. Read the warning.
expect: The stick is shown by name and size, and the warning says everything on it will be erased.
clause: F-INST-07.warning
step: Confirm and wait for the write to finish.
expect: A progress bar moves and ends with a message that the stick is ready. Nothing else on the computer is touched.
clause: F-INST-07.write
step: Eject the stick from DISKS.
expect: The page says it is safe to remove.
clause: F-INST-07.eject
step: Start another computer from the stick (hold the boot key of that computer).
expect: IYAKKI starts and reaches the sign-in or first-start screen.
clause: F-NET-17.boots
